ONNX Runtime Web 1.22.0-dev.20250409-89f8206ba4 (onnxruntime-web, npm): dist/ort.webgpu.min.mjs, copied unchanged
except for its source-map comment. It runs Socials' fast voices (Piper) with the WebAssembly files already in
vendor/transformers/ (the same ONNX Runtime build Transformers.js bundles).

